      "npc" : "Valkyrie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "the Hall of Honor.",
      "translation" : "荣誉之殿。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 207,
      "npc" : "Valkyrie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Valkyrie]",
      "translation" : "[女武神]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 208,
      "npc" : "Valkyrie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Unfortunately, you have not yet been invited here. I ask you to leave immediately. Honor to the warriors!",
      "translation" : "很遗憾，你还没有受邀来到这里。我请你立刻离开。愿荣耀归于勇士！"
    },
    {
